                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Which WhatsApp platform is best?</h3>
                                        <p>Wati or Interakt for growth-stage. Twilio for global / custom. AiSensy for budget-constrained SMB.</p>
                                        <h3>What's the cost per WhatsApp conversation?</h3>
                                        <p>₹0.35-3.50 per conversation (Meta charge) + platform fee. Marketing conversations are more expensive than utility.</p>
                                        <h3>Can I sell products directly inside WhatsApp?</h3>
                                        <p>In India, yes — WhatsApp Pay and catalog checkout support end-to-end. In UAE, catalog + payment link. USA/UK/Aus: payment link handoff typical.</p>
                                        <h3>How do I avoid getting rate-limited?</h3>
                                        <p>Strict opt-in, high-quality template messaging, careful cadence, and monitoring your quality rating in Meta Business Manager.</p>
